.TH CROND 1 "2026" "KERNEL32" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
crond \- demon d'execution planifiee / daemon to execute scheduled commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B crond
[-f]
.br
.B cron
[-f]
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs every minute the entries of /etc/crontab and /etc/cron.d/* (which carry a user field before the command) and of /var/spool/cron/crontabs/*. Job output is
appended to /var/log/cron.out. With -f stays in the foreground.
.SH SEE ALSO
crontab(1)
